    "summary": "Portrait of a young woman; single-page painting mounted on album folio. A young woman sits on an ornate, jewel encrusted chair with a roseate finial and a purple cushion foot rest. She wears a light blue waistcoat over an orange blouse and a bright pink skirt. On her head is a jewel and feather headdress with an orange veil. She holds out a yellow fruit in her right hand. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes.\r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
